    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d29">

                <pb facs="0165" n="41" sameAs="frus:frus1881/pg41"/>

                <head>No. 29.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Kasson to Mr. Evarts</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Vienna</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1881-03-08"><hi rendition="#italic">March</hi> 8, 1881</date>.
                        (Received March 25.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 433.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: The foreign office has voluntarily
                    transmitted to this legation a further communication on the subject of
                    renunciation of Austrian citizenship, indicating the present condition of the
                    law. It further states that now emigration is only limited by the duty of
                    military service.</p>
                <p>I inclose herewith a copy of the original communication, and a translation the
                    same.</p>
                <p>I have, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>JOHN A. KASSON.</signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d29-a1.xml" xpointer="d29-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
